      "body": "I tried with the Alpine CI, but only found a speed-up from 44s->40s on arm64.\n\nThe diff I used:\n\n```diff\nroot@ubuntu-32gb-hel1-1:~/b-c# uname --machine\naarch64\nroot@ubuntu-32gb-hel1-1:~/b-c# git diff -U1\ndiff --git a/ci/test/00_setup_env_native_alpine_musl.sh b/ci/test/00_setup_env_native_alpine_musl.sh\nindex 09b07b682c..cf94a61943 100755\n--- a/ci/test/00_setup_env_native_alpine_musl.sh\n+++ b/ci/test/00_setup_env_native_alpine_musl.sh\n@@ -11,5 +11,6 @@ export CI_BASE_PACKAGES=\"build-base musl-dev pkgconf curl ccache make ninja git\n export PIP_PACKAGES=\"--break-system-packages pyzmq pycapnp\"\n-export DEP_OPTS=\"DEBUG=1\"\n+export DEP_OPTS=\"DEBUG=1 NO_QT=1\"\n printf -v BITCOIN_CONFIG \"%q \" \\\n  --preset=dev-mode \\\n+ -DBUILD_GUI=OFF \\\n  -DREDUCE_EXPORTS=ON \\\ndiff --git a/ci/test/03_test_script.sh b/ci/test/03_test_script.sh\nindex 5d741936ae..72dbab4276 100755\n--- a/ci/test/03_test_script.sh\n+++ b/ci/test/03_test_script.sh\n@@ -127,2 +127,3 @@ fi\n # shellcheck disable=SC2086\n+BUILD_TARGETS=\"bench_bitcoin\"\n cmake --build \"${BASE_BUILD_DIR}\" \"$MAKEJOBS\" --target $BUILD_TARGETS || (\n@@ -133,2 +134,7 @@ cmake --build \"${BASE_BUILD_DIR}\" \"$MAKEJOBS\" --target $BUILD_TARGETS || (\n )\n+for i in {1..3}; do\n+  ( time \"${BASE_BUILD_DIR}/bin/bench_bitcoin\" -filter=WalletLoadingDescriptors -sanity-check ) &\n+done\n+wait\n+exit 0\n \n```\n\nI also tried with tsan on the same machine, but it too was not changed:\n\n```\nrm -rf ./bld-cmake/   &&  cmake -B ./bld-cmake -DAPPEND_CXXFLAGS='-O3 -g2' -DAPPEND_CFLAGS='-O3 -g2' -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug -DCMAKE_EXE_LINKER_FLAGS=-fuse-ld=mold -DCMAKE_C_COMPILER='clang' -DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER='clang++' --preset=dev-mode -DCMAKE_EXPORT_COMPILE_COMMANDS=ON -DSANITIZERS=thread -DAPPEND_CPPFLAGS=\"-DARENA_DEBUG -DDEBUG_LOCKCONTENTION\"                               && cmake --build ./bld-cmake --parallel  $(nproc) --target=bench_bitcoin && for i in {1..3}; do ( time ./bld-cmake/bin/bench_bitcoin -filter=WalletLoadingDescriptors -sanity-check ) & done; wait   \n```\n\n(both on tmpfs and inside a container)\n\n\nIt would be good to provide the exact steps to reproduce and the exact machine hardware to reproduce, ideally on Linux.",
